  "description": "Certificate of lawfulness (proposed) for the erection of a single storey rear extension and the conversion and extension of the existing loft space at 40 Strathnairn Street, London, SE1 5BL, forming part of a two-storey mid-terraced dwellinghouse, under permitted development.\r\rThe works include the formation of a single storey rear extension at ground floor level and a rear dormer extension to the existing roof. The loft conversion will provide an additional en-suite bedroom, including a shower room, storage/wardrobe space, and a new staircase connecting the first floor to the proposed loft level.\r\rThe additional accommodation at both ground and loft levels will form an integral part of the existing single dwellinghouse and will be used by the occupants of the property.",
